SOAPBOX: The band conditions for this year's CQWW 160 CW were marginal at best. And, I just didn’t put much of an effort into it this year. I was only on for five hours Saturday night. No runs, just S&P. I didn’t even break 200 Qs. Hearing, let alone working stations in the Pacific NW from my Lake MI location was a challenge. If not for KH6AQ, KP4AA, ZF5T, PJ2T, and my Canadian friends to the North, I would not have called this world-wide anything this year.
